  "description": "The role of media in shaping public perceptions of colonialism and its legacy, often through the promotion of colonial narratives that seek to erase or distort the experiences of colonized peoples. The meme critiques the idea of forgetting colonialism by implying that such media narratives are a form of historical minimization.",
